<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Verify Your Email</title>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        font-family: Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, "Times New Roman", serif;
        background-color: #f9f9f9;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 50px auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        text-align: center;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0px 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        padding: 30px;
      }
      .header {
        background-color: #f5f5f5;
        padding: 20px;
        border-top-left-radius: 10px;
        border-top-right-radius: 10px;
      }
      .header img {
        width: 140px;
        height: auto;
      }
      h1 {
        font-size: 19px;
        color: #333;
      }
      p {
        font-size: 16px;
        color: #555;
        margin: 15px 0;
      }
      .email {
        font-weight: bold;
      }
      .verify-button {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: #4f46e5;
        color: white;
        padding: 12px 25px;
        border-radius: 5px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: bold;
      }
      .verify-button:hover {
        background-color: #4338ca;
      }
      .link {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #666;
        margin-top: 15px;
      }
      .footer {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #aaa;
        margin-top: 20px;
      }
      .title {
        width: 600px;
        /* background-color: red; */
        text-align: left;
        font-size: 16px;
      }
      a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: #0c5197;
      }
      span {
        font-weight: 900;
      }

      .footer img {
        height: 140px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <img
          src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dn3mokfxz/image/upload/v1738163121/Animation_-_1738163008398_h58bnh.gif"
          alt="Rejected"
        />
      </div>
      <h1>Vendor Account Verification Unsuccessful</h1>
      <div class="title"><h3>Dear <%= storeName %></h3></div>
      <p>
        We regret to inform you that your vendor account verification on Mbaay
        was unsuccessful due to invalid credentials or missing details. To
        ensure a smooth verification process, please review your submission and
        try again.
      </p>
      <div class="title"><h3>Next Steps to Reverify Your Account:</h3></div>
      <div class="title">
        <p>
          🔹 Double-check that all required documents and details are correct
          and up to date.
        </p>
        <p>
          🔹 Ensure that the credentials provided match your official business
          information.
        </p>
        <p>🔹 Resubmit your application for verification.</p>
      </div>
      <h3><a href="#">🔗 Reverify Your Account</a></h3>
      <p>
        If you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to reach out to
        our support team.
      </p>
      <p>
        Best regards, <br />
        <span>The Mbaay Team</span>
      </p>
      <p class="footer">
        <img
          src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dn3mokfxz/image/upload/v1737988620/new_mbaay-removebg-preview_cyimbt.png"
          alt=""
        />
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
